{# The page that posts a SAML response to the assertion consumer service of a service provider (beffroi/saml,
   spec/saml.md section 6.8, spec/bindings.md section 6.7, SAML Bindings §3.5.4): its form, whose action and values Twig
   escapes for an HTML attribute, submitted by the one script below, which the Content-Security-Policy of the page
   names by its hash, never by "unsafe-inline"; a browser without scripting is shown the sentence and the button.
   This page does not extend the layout of the interaction plane, on purpose, as the page of the form post response
   mode does not: it carries a message of the protocol, and its policy is "default-src 'none'". Overridable by an
   application under templates/bundles/BeffroiBundle/, the script kept exactly as it is given: its hash is the policy. #}
{% trans_default_domain 'beffroi' %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ app.request.locale|replace({'_': '-'}) }}">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>{{ 'saml_post.title'|trans }}</title>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <form method="post" action="{{ action }}">
            {% for name, value in fields %}
                <input type="hidden" name="{{ name }}" value="{{ value }}">
            {% endfor %}
            <noscript>
                <p>{{ 'saml_post.explanation'|trans }}</p>
                <button type="submit">{{ 'saml_post.continue'|trans }}</button>
            </noscript>
        </form>
    </main>
    <script>{{ script|raw }}</script>
</body>
</html>
